# Keep secrets, data and host-built dependencies out of the build context.

# Secrets and host notes
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
instance-info.txt
docker/allow.conf

# Not part of the app
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
analysis
docs
*.md
aws-iam-policy*.json
deploy-ec2.sh
setup-aws-infrastructure.*
ecosystem*.config.js
document-register

# Dependencies are installed inside the image (the host's may be Windows builds)
**/node_modules

# Runtime data and build output
**/logs
**/temp
**/.ocr_cache
**/coverage
backend/services/outputs
frontend/dist
frontend/.angular
